          "content": "Two offline manipulable models accompany this unit: **First-order clearance** and **Idealized feedback attenuation**. Their equations are documented in `MODELS.json` and displayed beneath each control in the HTML reader. Vary one slider, describe the change and explain why the curve is a mathematical illustration rather than a measurement-based prediction. In particular, compare the default value to values at the edges of the slider; note which model assumptions would require reconsideration outside this idealized domain.",
